{"at":"2026-02-18T15:49:33.045Z","userId":"admin","page":{"id":757,"status":"published","language":"en","path":"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/your-account/creating-an-account/","title":"Creating an account","description":null,"body":"<article class=\"shortcode_info\" itemscope itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\r\n\t<div class=\"doc-post-content \" id=\"post\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"shortcode_title\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"ezd-doc-badge\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/your-account/\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\tYour Account\t\t\t\t\t</a>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Creating an account</h1>\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ezd-meta dot-sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"read-time\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEstimated reading: 2 minutes\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"views sep\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t787 views\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"doc-scrollable editor-content\">\r\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t<div class=\"doc-content-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"9389\" class=\"elementor elementor-9389\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5cf04ff e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"5cf04ff\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2a5b2b9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2a5b2b9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:152\">Creating a PropertyList account is a simple and straightforward process that can be completed in just a few minutes. Make sure your admin of the company opens the first account and then adds employees within the platform, this way you can keep track of all the contacts, events, pipeline and more of the whole company. To get started, follow these steps</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8d23adf e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"8d23adf\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-dda7f4c elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"dda7f4c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>Go to the <a href=\"https://PropertyList.es/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://PropertyList.es/</a></li><li>Click the &#8220;Sign Up&#8221; button.</li><li>Fill in your agency details</li></ul><p>Click &#8220;Next&#8221;.</p><ul><li>Add your agency&#8217;s website domain.</li><li>Choose your primary language.</li><li>Upload your company logo and an office photo.</li></ul><p>Click &#8220;Next&#8221;.</p><ul><li>Add your Admin User Account information.</li></ul><p>Click &#8220;Next&#8221;.</p><ul><li>Add your XML Import Feed. Need to upload your direct listings in bulk? Our system works with all major platforms, so integration should be easy! (optional) </li><li>Agree to the terms of service and privacy policy.</li></ul><div><b> </b></div><div><b style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">Once your account is created you can share your properties with other agents and link all the properties to your website and much more!</b></div><div> </div><div><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.15px; color: #6b707f;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>NOTE:</strong> </span>We recommend using the <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">XML feed first</span> to get your initial properties uploaded. Then, as you acquire new listings, you can </span><span style=\"color: #6b707f; letter-spacing: 0.15px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">manually</span><span style=\"color: #6b707f; letter-spacing: 0.15px; text-align: var(--text-align);\"> </span><span style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.15px; color: #6b707f;\">add them directly to PropertyList MLS for maximum control. <br />– We offer the same link for you to provide to other platforms, find out more here: </span><a style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.15px; text-decoration-line: none; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/managing-listings/export-listings-xml/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">XML Export.</a></div><div> </div><div> </div><div><b style=\"text-align: var(--text-align); color: var(--p_color); letter-spacing: 0.15px;\">Next be sure to <a href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/your-account/how-to-setup-company-staff-accounts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">add your Staff/Employees</a>, this will send them a link to join for free also within the agency.</b></div><p> </p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\r\n\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\r\n\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t    <div class=\"doc-btm\">\r\n                <div class=\"eazydocs-next-prev-wrap\">\r\n\t\t\t                <a class=\"next-prev-pager second\" href=\"/docs/propertylist-mls-user-manual/your-account/navigate-the-mls-dashboard-and-interface/\">\r\n                    <span> Next - Your Account </span>\r\n\t\t\t\t\tHow do I navigate the MLS dashboard and interface                </a>\r\n\t\t\t        </div>\r\n\t\t    </div>\r\n    </article>","seo_title":"Creating an account • PropertyList Info Hub","seo_description":null}}